    <briefdescription>
<para>Context-sensitive <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_capture_analysis" kindref="compound">CaptureAnalysis</ref> provider, which computes and caches the earliest common dominator closure of all captures. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It provides a good approximation to a precise &quot;captures before&quot; analysis. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
